WEBVTT

00:00:00.427 --> 00:00:04.174
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Adut Akech</b> was born in Sudan on Christmas Day.

00:00:04.519 --> 00:00:07.710
Her debut as a model was in a local fashion show.

00:00:08.124 --> 00:00:12.567
She appeared on the cover of <i>British Vogue</i> for the March 2024 issue,

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:16.200
which celebrated 40 icons in the fashion industry.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.658
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>Paul Mescal</b> is an Irish actor.

00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:24.891
His mother was a police officer and his father was a schoolteacher.

00:00:25.338 --> 00:00:28.910
The eldest of three children, he has a brother and a sister.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:35.268
He starred in <i>Gladiator II</i>, Ridley Scott’s sequel to the 2000 historical drama.

00:00:37.613 --> 00:00:41.003
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> <b>Billie Eilish</b> and her older brother were homeschooled,

00:00:41.284 --> 00:00:44.318
a decision their parents made to spend time with them

00:00:44.565 --> 00:00:50.170
and give them the freedom to pursue their interests, including art, dancing, and acting.

00:00:50.557 --> 00:00:56.820
Eilish did some acting auditions, but she disliked them and preferred to concentrate on music.